WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:13.680
And Joy Boy has returned, Luffy seemingly died and&nbsp;
then came back to life, and a new power awakened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:13.680 --> 00:00:20.560
inside of him – a power that could be a completely&nbsp;
new form, a devil fruit awakening, or something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.560 --> 00:00:26.560
even more insane! The One Piece story has reached&nbsp;
the point at which a massive reveal like this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:33.280
had to happen in order to set up a proper final&nbsp;
showdown on Laugh Tail, but by making this reveal,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:39.200
Oda may have just spoiled Luffy’s true power&nbsp;
and how this incredible story will finally end,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:54.080
so let’s get into it!
Like, sub.&nbsp;

00:00:58.160 --> 00:01:04.240
Playlist.
Spoilers.&nbsp;

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:16.640
So in the most recent chapters of the manga, the&nbsp;
CP0 members on Wano learn that the Gorosei have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:24.320
issued a critically important edict – Straw Hat&nbsp;
Luffy must be eliminated at once! He must not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:30.560
be allowed to defeat Kaido; he must be stopped&nbsp;
right here and now. As soon as we heard this,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.560 --> 00:01:34.880
we all immediately wondered why the&nbsp;
Gorosei are so determined to kill Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.880 --> 00:01:38.800
at this very moment. They are not even willing&nbsp;
to wait for Luffy’s fight with Kaido to end;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:39.840 --> 00:01:43.920
despite the fact that Kaido is known&nbsp;
as the world’s strongest creature,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:50.720
a man who seemingly cannot die, the Gorosei seem&nbsp;
to think that Luffy has a chance of defeating him,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:55.920
because the nameless Cp0 agent with the white&nbsp;
bowler hat seemingly sacrifices his life in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.920 --> 00:02:00.800
order to interfere in the Luffy and Kaido fight.
As a direct result of the agent’s interference,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:00.800 --> 00:02:06.240
Luffy takes a massive blow from Kaido head on.&nbsp;
He is sent crashing to the ground, he loses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:12.240
consciousness, and he is defeated. The narrator&nbsp;
confirms that Kaido is the winner of the battle,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:16.720
Momo also says that he can no longer hear&nbsp;
Luffy’s voice, and Kaido then declares&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:16.720 --> 00:02:23.200
that Monkey D. Luffy is DEAD. At this point, it&nbsp;
doesn’t look great for Luffy, and if he wasn’t&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:28.320
the main freaking protagonist, we might have been&nbsp;
tricked into thinking that he had actually died.&nbsp;

00:02:28.320 --> 00:02:33.920
But Luffy is the main protagonist, and as the&nbsp;
chapter comes to an end, we see Luffy’s supposedly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:39.840
lifeless body begin to smile. Steam is rising from&nbsp;
his body and his hair has turned into some sort of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:45.840
goop, as if it is melting. It is also implied&nbsp;
that Luffy’s heart had in fact stopped beating,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:45.840 --> 00:02:50.960
but then it started up again. The Japanese&nbsp;
word used to describe Luffy’s smile as he comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:58.720
back to life is NIKA, as in The Sun God Nika.
And as all of this is happening, Zunesha arrives.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:04.240
Zunesha, who is now confirmed to have&nbsp;
been a companion of Joy Boy 800 years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.240 --> 00:03:10.000
says the following: MOMONOSUKE, I CAN&nbsp;
HEAR IT! HOW LONG IT’S BEEN. I HEAR&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.000 --> 00:03:18.480
THE DRUMS OF LIBERATION. FOR THE FIRST TIME IN&nbsp;
800 YEARS… HE IS HERE! JOY BOY HAS RETURNED!&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:24.800
What an incredible chapter, what an insane&nbsp;
cliffhanger, and as you might expect,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:29.440
this unbelievable turn of events has made the&nbsp;
One Piece community lose its mind. And for once&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:35.360
it’s completely justified. The long-awaited Joy&nbsp;
Boy has returned, he is clearly implied to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.360 --> 00:03:41.040
the same person as the legendary Sun God Nika, and&nbsp;
Luffy who was supposed to be dead has now returned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:46.720
to life with some sort of new form or new power&nbsp;
or devil fruit awakening or all of the above!&nbsp;

00:03:46.720 --> 00:03:50.160
Okay so let’s talk about Joy Boy and&nbsp;
Nika, what we know about them so far,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:54.880
and how both of these legendary and mythical&nbsp;
figures seem to have awakened within one man,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.880 --> 00:04:00.240
Monkey D. Luffy. On the Ryugyu Poneglpyh, a&nbsp;
man from the surface known only as Joy Boy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:05.680
apologizes to the people of Fishman Island for&nbsp;
breaking his part of an ancient promise. This&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:05.680 --> 00:04:10.000
apology was written during the Void Century,&nbsp;
and the nature of the letter shows that this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.120
Joy Boy had a strong connection to the people of&nbsp;
Fishman Island, despite the fact that he himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.120 --> 00:04:20.000
was from the surface. This is significant in and&nbsp;
of itself, because although our knowledge of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:25.040
Void Century is limited, due to everything else&nbsp;
we know about the history of the One Piece world,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.440
it is safe to assume that back then the Fish-Men&nbsp;
were actively discriminated against by people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:34.480
on the surface. And yet Joy Boy clearly wasn’t&nbsp;
one of those who discriminated against them.&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:40.640
Joy Boy is believed to have lived some 900 years&nbsp;
ago, so at the beginning of the Void Century,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:40.640 --> 00:04:45.040
but since the Poneglyphs are believed to have been&nbsp;
invented by the Kozuki clan some 800 years ago,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.440
the Ryugyu Poneglyph must have been created&nbsp;
around the end of the Void Century. So there&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.360
seems to be a gap of about 100 years between&nbsp;
the time that Joy Boy is believed to have made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.360 --> 00:04:57.120
a promise to the people of Fishman Island, and&nbsp;
the time that the Ryugyu Poneglyph was created.&nbsp;

00:04:57.120 --> 00:05:02.160
In terms of the promise itself, the people of&nbsp;
Fishman island promised to keep Noah safe until&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:02.160 --> 00:05:07.120
a certain day. Keeping Noah safe was their&nbsp;
part of the promise. Joy Boy’s part of the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:11.600
promise was most likely that he would&nbsp;
use the power of Poseidon to bring Noah&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:11.600 --> 00:05:16.320
up to the surface. It is also likely that Noah’s&nbsp;
true purpose was to serve as an arc that would&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:16.320 --> 00:05:20.640
relocate all the people of Fishman Island up&nbsp;
to the surface, something that many Fishmen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.640 --> 00:05:24.960
have dreamed of for centuries, but we were never&nbsp;
able to achieve due to the rampant discrimination&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.560 --> 00:05:29.200
that they faced on the surface. Again, Joy&nbsp;
Boy is someone from the surface who not only&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:34.240
refuses to discriminate against the Fish-Men, but&nbsp;
actually wants to liberate them and bring them up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:34.240 --> 00:05:39.840
to the surface. This tells us a lot about Joy&nbsp;
Boy, and it draws a clear parallel between him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:43.760
and the legend of the Sun God Nika.
Joy Boy is also the man who left a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.760 --> 00:05:48.240
priceless treasure known as the One Piece on a&nbsp;
mysterious island at the end of the New World.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.240 --> 00:05:51.360
This island was discovered by Gol&nbsp;
D. Roger and his crew 25 years ago.&nbsp;

00:05:56.320 --> 00:06:00.240
Since the people of Fishman Island continue&nbsp;
to faithfully watch over Noah in order to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:00.240 --> 00:06:04.400
keep their end of the promise to Joy Boy,&nbsp;
it is implied that this Joy Boy will one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:08.240
day return to fulfill his part of the promise&nbsp;
to the people of Fishman island. And now we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.240 --> 00:06:13.440
know that he has indeed returned, even if we&nbsp;
don’t know all the precise details just yet.&nbsp;

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:19.040
Now let’s talk about Nika, a legendary warrior&nbsp;
that was worshipped as the Sun God by slaves&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:23.600
in ancient times. The legend of Nika says&nbsp;
that he would one day come to liberate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:29.120
all the slaves and bring smiles to their faces&nbsp;
– and again, bringing freedom and joy to those&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:35.120
who are oppressed is something that both Joy Boy&nbsp;
and Nika have in common. Combine this with Zunesha&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:40.640
talking about the drums of liberation, and there&nbsp;
is a strong implication that Nika and Joy Boy are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:45.520
the same person, an ancient warrior who wanted to&nbsp;
liberate those who were enslaved and oppressed,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:45.520 --> 00:06:52.000
including the Fishmen. Luffy appears to be&nbsp;
the modern embodiment of this ancient warrior,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:56.320
and so he may be destined to succeed&nbsp;
where the original Joy Boy failed.&nbsp;

00:06:56.320 --> 00:07:01.440
The most recent chapters foreshadowed this very&nbsp;
thing, because during the battle between Kaido&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:07.280
and Luffy, we saw Luffy going all out and trying&nbsp;
to surpass his limits because he is so concerned&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:12.160
about the people of Wano. He knows that if he&nbsp;
loses to Kaido, the people of Wano will continue&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:16.720
to be enslaved, and they will not even have clean&nbsp;
water to drink as their homeland continues to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:16.720 --> 00:07:22.240
be polluted by Kaido’s factories. This is the&nbsp;
primary driving force behind Luffy’s desire to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:27.920
defeat Kaido – he wants to liberate the people&nbsp;
of Wano from their enslavement, a goal that is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:34.320
certainly consistent with the idea that Luffy&nbsp;
is the modern embodiment of Joy Boy and Nika.&nbsp;

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:46.320
Meanwhile, Kaido, who was himself once&nbsp;
a potential candidate for being Joy Boy,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:51.920
has the exact opposite goal. He wishes to continue&nbsp;
enslaving the people of Wano for his own ends,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:56.320
and the fact that they dared rebel against him&nbsp;
means that he is now justified in treating them&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.320 --> 00:08:01.280
more severely than ever before. Perhaps Kaido&nbsp;
had embodied the spirit of Joy Boy at some point&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:07.120
in his past, but that is clearly no longer the&nbsp;
case. On the other hand, Luffy fully embodies&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:13.040
the true spirit of Joy Boy and Nika, and that is&nbsp;
almost certainly why he is now undergoing this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.040 --> 00:08:19.200
incredible transformation right before our eyes.
But speaking of this new goopy transformation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.200 --> 00:08:24.800
what exactly is happening here? Is Luffy&nbsp;
simply awakening a new gear or new form,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:31.040
is he awakening a new ability, is his devil fruit&nbsp;
itself awakening, or is the actual spirit of Joy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:37.760
Boy/Nika awakening inside of him? Is this&nbsp;
new resurrected Luffy going to be the same&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:42.960
Monkey D. Luffy that we love, or is he going to&nbsp;
be different now because a new consciousness has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:42.960 --> 00:08:49.040
awoken inside of him? Is Luffy going to become&nbsp;
the historical person known as Joy Boy, is he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.040 --> 00:08:53.840
going to stay the same but unlock new powers, or&nbsp;
is it going to be some combination of the two?&nbsp;

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:59.600
These are the big questions that we need to&nbsp;
talk about right now. The best place to start&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:04.720
is Luffy’s devil fruit, because the manga has&nbsp;
been hinting heavily that the Gomu Gomu no Mi is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:09.840
far more important than we had initially realized.&nbsp;
It seems clear that Luffy’s fruit is not actually&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:15.280
called Gomu Gomu no Mi. Its true name was hidden&nbsp;
by the World Government, because this devil fruit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:21.120
is a secret legendary fruit that hasn’t awakened&nbsp;
for centuries. This devil fruit is so dangerous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:25.440
that the World Government tried to keep it&nbsp;
completely under wraps, but Shanks managed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:25.440 --> 00:09:30.560
to steal it from the World government, and then&nbsp;
Luffy accidentally ate it when he was a kid.&nbsp;

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:35.600
But assuming that Luffy’s fruit is the legendary&nbsp;
fruit that hasn’t awakened in centuries,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:40.640
why is it so dangerous? Was this&nbsp;
the original Joy Boy’s fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:45.520
and does it still have some part of him inside&nbsp;
of it – perhaps his will or some special power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:51.440
that he possesses? Is this even a rubber fruit&nbsp;
at all, or could it be something else entirely,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:56.000
and the rubber may just be one&nbsp;
small aspect of its true powers?&nbsp;

00:09:56.000 --> 00:10:00.933
Now this could be just a standard devil fruit&nbsp;
awakening, similar to Katakuri’s mochi mochi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.933 --> 00:10:06.880
no mi, which has many similar properties to the&nbsp;
gomu gomu no mi. Luffy may develop the ability&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.880 --> 00:10:12.240
transform his body like a logia user, and he may&nbsp;
even learn to turn nearby inorganic materials&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:19.280
into rubber. This would certainly be a sick&nbsp;
powerup for him, but if this is all that’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:24.560
going on, then the whole Joy Boy is back stuff&nbsp;
doesn’t seem to be related to it. Luffy’s devil&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:30.240
fruit could awaken like Katakuri’s without Luffy&nbsp;
dying and being reborn as Joy Boy, so the heavily&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:35.120
emphasized Joy Boy connection seems to indicate&nbsp;
that there might be something else going on here.&nbsp;

00:10:35.120 --> 00:10:40.080
Because it’s been implied that the gomu gomu no&nbsp;
mi is not the real name of Luffy’s devil fruit,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.080 --> 00:10:46.000
it is possible that rubber related powers are&nbsp;
just one aspect of the fruit’s full potential.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.400
Maybe Luffy can use other abilities&nbsp;
beyond just rubber-based powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:56.400
and he just didn’t realize it yet. For example,&nbsp;
maybe his actual ability is burning rubber, so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:56.400 --> 00:11:04.000
a combination of fire and rubber, or a combination&nbsp;
of rubber and lava, or rubber and another element.&nbsp;

00:11:04.000 --> 00:11:09.120
There is also a lot of speculation that Luffy’s&nbsp;
real devil fruit may actually be a Mythical Zone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:09.120 --> 00:11:13.760
like the Monkey King Sun Wukong fruit. I&nbsp;
think that this would be extremely cool;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:18.160
I’ve read A Journey to the West and Sun&nbsp;
Wukong has some a lot of awesome powers,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:18.160 --> 00:11:23.200
and of course Luffy’s character definitely&nbsp;
has that Monkey King energy. But even though&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.200 --> 00:11:28.320
the Monkey King fruit would definitely be a good&nbsp;
fit for Luffy, the fact that his devil fruit is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:33.040
dangerous legendary fruit that hasn’t awakened for&nbsp;
centuries means that it is likely directly related&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:38.080
to Joy Boy and Nika. And I think that in order&nbsp;
to better understand how Luffy’s new power could&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.080 --> 00:11:43.280
directly connect to two legendary ancient figures&nbsp;
like Joy Boy and Nika, we need to go back to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:43.280 --> 00:11:48.640
beginning. And by that I don’t just mean the&nbsp;
void century, but even before the void century.&nbsp;

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:54.560
We need to go back to over 1,100 years ago in the&nbsp;
world of One Piece to the advanced civilization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:54.560 --> 00:11:59.760
that inhabited the moon, the same civilizations&nbsp;
whose descendants are modern day Skypieans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:06.240
Shandorians, and Birkans. But to find the&nbsp;
answers we need, we first have to go to go back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.240 --> 00:12:13.440
3500 years in our own world and take a look&nbsp;
at the Olmec Civilization of Mesoamerica.&nbsp;

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:16.960
Now it is pretty clear that the Ancient&nbsp;
civilization on the moon, along with all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:22.080
of their descendant civilizations, are heavily&nbsp;
inspired by ancient Mesoamerican civilizations,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:27.760
including the Aztecs and Mayans. The parallels are&nbsp;
blatantly clear when we look at the architecture,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:31.920
art, and culture of these civilizations&nbsp;
in One Piece and compare them to the real&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:31.920 --> 00:12:37.840
life Mesoamerican Civilizations. I mean this&nbsp;
particular statue of Quetzalcoatl the Feathered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:37.840 --> 00:12:42.720
Serpent god from Aztec religion seems to have&nbsp;
been directly taken from real life and drawn&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:42.720 --> 00:12:43.760
into One Piece (Shandora in episode 174 vs.&nbsp;
Real Aztec Statues of Quetzalcoatl’s head).&nbsp;

00:12:43.760 --> 00:12:47.760
But while I’ve seen a lot of talk about&nbsp;
the Sky civilizations being inspired by&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:47.760 --> 00:12:53.200
the Aztecs and Mayans, I rarely hear talk&nbsp;
about the Olmecs, who predate the Aztecs and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:53.200 --> 00:12:58.640
Mayans and without whom the Aztecs, Mayans, and&nbsp;
other Mesoamerican civilizations would not have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:04.400
existed. The Olmec are considered to be the&nbsp;
first major civilization of ancient Mexico,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:11.280
and their history dates all the way back to 1500&nbsp;
BC. This is many centuries before the Aztec and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:16.560
Mayan empires would flourish in Mesoamerica.
It is believed that the Olmec civilization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:20.880
pioneered many of the things that later&nbsp;
Mesoamerican civilizations would become known for,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:20.880 --> 00:13:26.000
including that famous Mayan calendar, the ball&nbsp;
games that the Mesoamerican people played,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:32.720
and even the gods that they worshipped. It can&nbsp;
all be traced back to the Olmecs. So the Olmecs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:38.720
could be seen as the ancestors of the Mayans and&nbsp;
Aztecs just like the Moon People are the ancestors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:45.360
of the Shandorians, Skypeians, and Birkas.
But here’s the crazy thing about the Olmec&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:45.360 --> 00:13:52.320
People. Olmec literally means THE RUBBER PEOPLE,&nbsp;
because they lived in an area that was known&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:52.320 --> 00:13:57.520
for producing rubber. Now Olmec is not what the&nbsp;
people called themselves, we don’t know what they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:57.520 --> 00:14:02.240
called themselves, but this name was given to them&nbsp;
because of the rubber-producing area that they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:07.680
inhabited. The Olmecs did not leave behind any&nbsp;
written history or oral traditions, so everything&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:12.240
we know about them comes from artifacts, and from&nbsp;
the influence that their civilization had on the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.040
civilizations that came later. If this gives you&nbsp;
the same vibes as the moon civilization and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:22.560
void century, trust me, you’re not the only one.
The Olmecs are probably best known for creating&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:22.560 --> 00:14:29.120
giant head statues, some of which are over&nbsp;
3 meters in height. These stone heads are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:29.120 --> 00:14:33.520
big enough for a certain Giant Straw Hat at&nbsp;
Mariegeoise to fit them. And speaking of giants,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:39.360
the jaguar is a very important sacred animal in&nbsp;
Mesoamerica, so it is possible that the giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:44.240
Jaguar D. Saul will turn out to be&nbsp;
more important than we even realize.&nbsp;

00:14:44.240 --> 00:14:48.960
Now many people have heard of the Aztec god&nbsp;
Quetzalcoatl, who often takes the shape of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:48.960 --> 00:14:53.360
a feathered serpent. Some have discussed&nbsp;
the potential connection between Luffy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:58.240
and Quetzalcoatl in the past, especially&nbsp;
because Quetzalcoatl was the god of the sun&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:58.240 --> 00:15:05.120
and of the dawn, as well as of the winds and the&nbsp;
sky. Nika is the sun god, Joy Boy and Luffy are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:05.120 --> 00:15:11.200
going to bring about a new dawn, so Quetzalcoatl&nbsp;
the feathered serpent may be an even better fit&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:17.040
for Luffy’s hypothetical mythical zoan devil&nbsp;
fruit than the monkey king Sun Wukong. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:17.040 --> 00:15:21.600
most people don’t realize that this divine&nbsp;
feathered serpent that the Aztecs worshipped&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:29.840
as Quetzalcoatl actually originated with&nbsp;
the Olmecs, who also worshipped a feathered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:36.080
serpent deity. If the sky races represent the&nbsp;
newer civilizations such as the Aztecs and Mayans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:42.240
then the moon civilization represents to Olmecs,&nbsp;
and so the truth about Nika, Joy Boy, and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:15:42.240 --> 00:15:47.680
true nature of Luffy’s legendary devil fruit&nbsp;
may lead all the way back to the moon itself.&nbsp;

00:15:51.120 --> 00:16:03.680
And the similarities between Nika, Joy Boy,&nbsp;
and the feathered serpent deity that came&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:10.000
to be known as Quetzalcoatl don’t end there. The&nbsp;
rulers of ancient Mesoamerica would often equate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:10.000 --> 00:16:16.640
themselves with Quetzalcoatl, implying that they&nbsp;
were his current incarnation or reincarnation on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:16.640 --> 00:16:22.560
earth. The Aztec people believed that Quetzalcoatl&nbsp;
would one day return to earth, and according to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:22.560 --> 00:16:29.440
some historical sources, when Hernan Cortes and&nbsp;
the Conquistadors landed in America in 1519,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:29.440 --> 00:16:34.880
Aztec Emperor Montezuma II believed that&nbsp;
Cortes was actually Quetzalcoatl returning&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:39.760
to claim his throne. Whether this is actually&nbsp;
true is still disputed by other historians,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:39.760 --> 00:16:44.720
but this idea of Quetzalcoatl being incarnated&nbsp;
as different rulers and returning to earth to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:44.720 --> 00:16:51.040
claim his throne definitely gives off strong Joy&nbsp;
Boy and Nika energy. Side note, but Gan Fall and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:56.080
his armor seem to be a direct reference to Spanish&nbsp;
Conquistadors, which again stresses the parallels&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:56.080 --> 00:17:00.800
between Mesoamerica and the Sky Peoples.
Even in terms of his personality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:05.760
what we know about Quetzalcoatl echoes what we&nbsp;
know about Joy Boy and Nika. Although in modern&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:05.760 --> 00:17:11.680
western culture serpents are often associated with&nbsp;
sinister things, Quetzalcoatl was actually a kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:11.680 --> 00:17:17.760
and gentle deity, and he did not want to harm any&nbsp;
living creature. He was a benefactor of mankind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:17.760 --> 00:17:21.760
and he gifted them incredibly valuable&nbsp;
knowledge, including farming, medicine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:28.400
and other important crafts. He was loved by the&nbsp;
people and he brought them joy. Oh and if you’re&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:33.920
looking for a monkey connection, in his form as&nbsp;
Ehecatl he is the wind, and he is represented&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:33.920 --> 00:17:39.840
by spider monkeys, among other creatures.
So if the key to Luffy’s new transformation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:39.840 --> 00:17:45.600
and the ending of One Piece itself lies with the&nbsp;
Olmecs and their Mesoamerican descendants, do we&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:45.600 --> 00:17:52.480
have any clues about what Luffy’s new power could&nbsp;
be? Well shapeshifting is a very popular power&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:52.480 --> 00:17:57.520
among Mesoamerican gods including Quetzalcoatl,&nbsp;
and since he can take the form of a giant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:17:57.520 --> 00:18:03.920
feathered serpent, he can also fly and his powers&nbsp;
are associated with the sun, the sky, and wind.&nbsp;

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:12.800
In terms of the rubber connection, the ancient&nbsp;
Mesoamericans were the first peoples to invent&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:16.800
rubber balls, and they were a very&nbsp;
important part of their culture.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:22.480
They could be used for playing ball games, or&nbsp;
as important religious offerings, among other&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:22.480 --> 00:18:28.160
uses. Another Aztec god who represents the morning&nbsp;
star Venus, and whose name can be translated as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:28.160 --> 00:18:33.920
Dawn Lord or Lord of the Dawn, is associated with&nbsp;
powerful rays that are able to hurt people and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:33.920 --> 00:18:39.040
crops. The interesting thing about this deity&nbsp;
is that there is a known image of him burning a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:39.040 --> 00:18:45.200
rubber ball, so again that whole burning rubber&nbsp;
and melting rubber aspect could come into play.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:45.200 --> 00:18:49.600
Also you might have noticed that I didn’t tell&nbsp;
you this deity’s name, so I guess I have to do&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:58.880
that now. Sigh. His name is Tlahuizcalpantecuhtli.
It is important to mention that to both the Aztecs&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:58.880 --> 00:19:04.640
and the Maya, the rubber latex that flowed&nbsp;
from the tree represented blood and seamen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:04.640 --> 00:19:10.560
Rubber was symbolic of fertility, of new&nbsp;
life, and was often burned, buried, or laid&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:10.560 --> 00:19:15.920
in a sacrificial pool as an offering to deities.
Now I don’t think Luffy’s power will be that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:20.640
other thing, but something associated with&nbsp;
blood could be a part of the equation.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:26.560
Bloodletting played a massively important part in&nbsp;
Mesoamerican religions, and Luffy has already used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:26.560 --> 00:19:31.920
a form of blood manipulation as far back as Gear&nbsp;
Two. He has also used air manipulation to blow air&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:38.960
into his body, so that wind and air connection&nbsp;
to Quetzalcoatl could also come into play.&nbsp;

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:43.280
All in all, I think that there are many&nbsp;
fascinating theories regarding Luffy’s new form&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:43.280 --> 00:19:47.600
and powers, and his connection to Joy Boy. I’m a&nbsp;
fan of many of them, including Sun Wukong theory,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:52.800
but I don’t think we can underestimate the&nbsp;
importance of the Rubber People – the Olmecs – and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:58.240
the Mesoamerican connections to the ancient&nbsp;
kingdom, the void century, and the civilization&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:58.240 --> 00:20:04.160
on the moon. Joy Boy, Nika, the gomu gomu no mi,&nbsp;
and the one piece itself are all going to take us&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:09.840
back to the ancient kingdom, and the best clues&nbsp;
we have about the true nature of that kingdom&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:14.960
are the real life kingdoms that inspired it.
